    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ball. You roll, you jump, you fall. You try again.<br><strong>The Masochistic Ball</strong> is a 2D platformer that starts off light-hearted\u2026 then steadily descends into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of <strong>40 carefully designed levels</strong>, the difficulty grows \u2014 from smooth and approachable beginnings to brutally demanding challenges that test your <strong>timing, control, and persistence</strong>.<br>No enemies. No guns. Just pure platforming and the sweet taste of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Masochistic Ball</strong> is for players who like a good struggle, a satisfying climb, and that tiny voice that says <i>\u201cokay, just one more try.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to roll all the way to the end?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ball. You roll, you jump, you fall. You try again.<br><strong>The Masochistic Ball</strong> is a 2D platformer that starts off light-hearted\u2026 then steadily descends into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of <strong>40 carefully designed levels</strong>, the difficulty grows \u2014 from smooth and approachable beginnings to brutally demanding challenges that test your <strong>timing, control, and persistence</strong>.<br>No enemies. No guns. Just pure platforming and the sweet taste of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Masochistic Ball</strong> is for players who like a good struggle, a satisfying climb, and that tiny voice that says <i>\u201cokay, just one more try.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to roll all the way to the end?</p>",
    "short_description": "Roll. Jump. Fall. Repeat. The Masochistic Ball is a precision 2D platformer with a rising difficulty curve. The early levels welcome everyone. The final ones? Pure nightmare fuel. 40 levels. No enemies. Just you, gravity, and your will to endure.",
